 "remarks": "Location is everything when you're searching for the perfect place to call home, and 46 Prospect Avenue delivers. Enjoy Norwalk Harbor views from this sunny, spacious two-bedroom on the third floor. Forget the stress of street parking. You'll have your own covered garage space plus a second spot in the lot. Even better, you can cross heating, water, hot water, and cooking gas off your list of worries, since they're all included in the common charges. The building keeps life simple with on-site coin-operated laundry and a dedicated small storage area for your extra gear. You're within easy walking distance to Norwalk Hospital and just a short trip from the South Norwalk (SoNo) train station, making any commute a breeze. When you're off the clock, you're minutes away from the best of SoNo: browse the SoNo Collection Mall, explore the waterfront, or grab a bite at one of the area's popular restaurants. Ready to stop searching and start packing?",
